{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2023-04-03 06:00:00', 'title': 'CUMMINS ANNOUNCES INVESTMENTS OF MORE THAN $1 BILLION ACROSS U.S. MANUFACTURING NETWORK', 'text': "COLUMBUS, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #CUMMINS--ON MONDAY, APRIL 3, PRESIDENT BIDEN WILL VISIT CUMMINS INC. (NYSE: CMI) IN FRIDLEY, MINNESOTA (USA) AS PART OF HIS ADMINISTRATION'S INVESTING IN AMERICA TOUR. DURING THE VISIT, PRESIDENT BIDEN WILL DISCUSS HOW HIS INVESTING IN AMERICA AGENDA IS SUPPORTING MANUFACTURING, INNOVATION AND A CLEAN ENERGY ECONOMY, AS WELL AS CREATING GOOD-PAYING JOBS IN COMMUNITIES LIKE FRIDLEY AND ACROSS THE COUNTRY."}